- the learning rate under the sample-heavy 1-epoch recipe;
- a per-layer encoder that sees neighbouring cells at its own layer, which matters for bridges and overhangs;
- a separate critic. A shared trunk can let value-loss gradients interfere with the policy features, and DONE timing depends on accurate value estimates.
Each candidate changes one thing from an earlier trial, and each has an estimated r of 2.2 or less, well inside the time limit.
